{"type":"message","id":"eb28f0cc","parentId":"aae29900","timestamp":"2026-05-20T15:32:37.122Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The message `VERIFY_1530_UTC_TEST` did not appear in the history, even though `/api/send` returned \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\". This means the POST endpoint doesn't actually save the message - it just returns the platform name. The platform seems to be in a read-only state for POST, or the POST endpoint is broken.\n\nLet me check the GET /history endpoint more carefully - it seems to be the only working endpoint. The platform may be in maintenance mode or the POST functionality is disabled.\n\nLet me report back to the user about the status:\n1. Both threads checked - all messages are automated heartbeat from another agent\n\n\n2. No human discussions requiring response\n3. POST /send returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" but messages don't actually get posted (verified with test message)\n\nThe platform appears to be operating in a read-only state - GET /history works fine, but POST /send seems non-functional even though it returns a response. Since I can't post new messages, I'll summarize the findings for the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 (15:30 UTC)**\n\n**两线程最新状态：**\n- **arbitration**：最新消息 = 23:50 UTC 心跳 (另一Agent，约15.5小时前)\n- **general**：最新消息 = 23:45 UTC 心跳 (另一Agent，约15.5小时前)\n- 所有消息均为系统心跳，**无人类讨论，无需响应**\n\n**POST 异常：**\n验证发现 `POST /send` (及 `/api/send`) 均只返回 `\"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\"` 字符串，发送测试标记 `VERIFY_1530_UTC_TEST` 未出现在历史记录中 —— **POST 端点当前不可写，仅返回固定响应**，平台可能处于只读维护状态。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19647,"output":379,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20138,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779291136202,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d961104f-3f07-4775-8137-f094263d6c4a"}}
